{\plain {\b 420squ.mcd}{   To compute the
 average distortion due to uniform quantization
 of a standard normal random variable. We
 can, by trial and error, approximate the
 quantization step size} {\f2 d} that minimizes
 the average diatortion. The standard normal
 density function is }
}
